CurrentAmount [SimTalk] - Mixer
Returns the Current Amount of the material in the mixing container of the Mixer designated by <Path>.
Type
Read-only attribute
Syntax
<Path>.CurrentAmount → real
Return Value
The return value has the data type real.
The current amount is measured in liters.
Example
print MyMixer.CurrentAmount
See also
Current Amount [Mixer]
CurrentAmount [SimTalk] - Mixer
Plant Simulation Help 11-2843
Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

CurrentFillLevel [SimTalk] - Mixer
Returns the Current Fill Level of the material in the mixing container of the Mixer designated by <Path>.
Type
Read-only attribute
Syntax
<Path>.CurrentFillLevel → real
Return Value
The return value has the data type real.
The current amount is measured in percent.
Example
print MyMixer.CurrentFillLevel
See also
Current Fill Level [Mixer]
