Empty [SimTalk] - Mixer
Returns if the Mixer designated by <Path> is Empty (true) or not (false).
Type
Read-only attribute
Syntax
<Path>.Empty → boolean
Watchable
The read-only attribute is watchable.
Return Value
The return value has the data type boolean.
Example
print MyMixer.Empty
See also
Full [SimTalk] - Mixer
Empty [SimTalk] - Mixer
Plant Simulation Help 11-2845
Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

EntranceOpen [SimTalk] - Mixer
Returns if material can enter the Mixer designated by <Path> because of current recovery times (true) or
not (false).
Type
Read-only attribute
Syntax
<Path>.EntranceOpen → boolean
Return Value
The return value has the data type boolean.
Example
print MyMixer.EntranceOpen
SimTalk
TimeUntilEntranceOpen [SimTalk] - Mixer
See also
Entrance Locked [material flow objects]
