Ready [SimTalk] - Mixer
Returns if the Mixer designated by <Path> is done mixing the ingredients (true) or not (false) and Ready
for a new mixing process.
Type
Read-only attribute
Syntax
<Path>.Ready → boolean
Watchable
The read-only attribute is watchable.
Return Value
The return value has the data type boolean.
Example
print MyMixer.Ready
