StatThroughput [SimTalk] - Mixer
Returns the Throughput, i.e., the amount of the product that the Mixer designated by <Path> mixed using
the ingredients.
Type
Read-only attribute
Syntax
<Path>.StatThroughput → real
Return Value
The return value has the data type real.
The throughput is measured in liters.
Example
print MyMixer.StatThroughput
See also
Tab Statistics [FluidDrain]
StatThroughput [SimTalk] - Mixer
Plant Simulation Help 11-2849
Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

TimeUntilEntranceOpen [SimTalk] - Mixer
Returns the time until the entrance of the Mixer designated by <Path> opens again after the recovery time
has elapsed.
Type
Read-only attribute
Syntax
<Path>.TimeUntilEntranceOpen → real
Return Value
The return value has the data type real.
Example
print MyMixer.TimeUntilEntranceOpen
See also
EntranceOpen [SimTalk] - Mixer
